Construct a FabricationConcept draft with its actual domain fields. Only supported values enter `values`; preserve conflicts, missing fields and evidence bindings. Propose distinct concepts using the shop’s supplied capabilities and approved materials. Explain appearance, cost, durability, and lead-time tradeoffs without claiming unsupported performance; preserve essential customer constraints across creative alternatives.
